127},"end":{"line":5,"column":81,"offset":207}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"雖然 SPL-Token 程式能有效處理代幣的核心機制，例如擁有權和供應量，但沒有元數據的代幣在錢包和瀏覽器中顯示為匿名的公鑰。","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1,"offset":211},"end":{"line":7,"column":65,"offset":275}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1,"offset":211},"end":{"line":7,"column":65,"offset":275}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Metaplex 通過提供應用程式和用戶所需的上下文信息，將這些基本的區塊鏈條目轉變為有意義的數字資產。","position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1,"offset":279},"end":{"line":9,"column":53,"offset":331}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1,"offset":279},"end":{"line":9,"column":53,"offset":331}}},{"type":"mdxJsxFlowElement","name":"ArticleSection","attributes":[{"type":"mdxJsxAttribute","name":"name","value":"Metadata Account","position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":17,"offset":351},"end":{"line":11,"column":40,"offset":374}}},{"type":"mdxJsxAttribute","name":"id","value":"metadata-account","position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":41,"offset":375},"end":{"line":11,"column":62,"offset":396}}},{"type":"mdxJsxAttribute","name":"level","value":"h2","position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":63,"offset":397},"end":{"line":11,"column":73,"offset":407}}}],"children":[],"position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":1,"offset":335},"end":{"line":11,"column":76,"offset":410}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Metadata","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1,"offset":414},"end":{"line":13,"column":11,"offset":424}}},{"type":"text","value":" 帳戶作為描述層，為區塊鏈代幣提供上下文和實用性。此帳戶結構使用 Solana 的程式衍生地址系統，為每個代幣與其相關信息之間建立可靠的關係。","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":11,"offset":424},"end":{"line":13,"column":82,"offset":495}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1,"offset":414},"end":{"line":13,"column":82,"offset":495}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"確定性地址生成確保每個鑄造帳戶都有一個對應的元數據帳戶，建立清晰的數據擁有權並防止衝突。","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":1,"offset":499},"end":{"line":15,"column":45,"offset":543}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":1,"offset":499},"end":{"line":15,"column":45,"offset":543}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Metadata","position":{"start":{"line":17,"column":1,"offset":547},"end":{"line":17,"column":11,"offset":557}}},{"type":"text","value":" 帳戶通過結合特定的種子值與鑄造帳戶的公鑰，使用確定性過程來生成其地址：","position":{"start":{"line":17,"column":11,"offset":557},"end":{"line":17,"column":47,"offset":593}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":17,"column":1,"offset":547},"end":{"line":17,"column":47,"offset":593}}},{"type":"code","lang":"rust","meta":null,"value":"const ID: Pubkey = solana_pubkey::pubkey!(\"metaqbxxUerdq28cj1RbAWkYQm3ybzjb6a8bt518x1s\");\r\n\r\nconst PREFIX: &str = \"metadata\";\r\n\r\nlet (metadata, _) = Pubkey::find_program_address(\r\n    &[\r\n        PREFIX.as_bytes(), \r\n        &ID, \r\n        mint.as_ref()\r\n    ], \r\n    &ID  \r\n);","position":{"start":{"line":19,"column":1,"offset":597},"end":{"line":32,"column":4,"offset":888}},"data":{"highlightId":"code-0"}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Metadata","position":{"start":{"line":34,"column":1,"offset":892},"end":{"line":34,"column":11,"offset":902}}},{"type":"text","value":" 帳戶存儲了超越基本代幣標識符的全面信息。","position":{"start":{"line":34,"column":11,"offset":902},"end":{"line":34,"column":32,"offset":923}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":34,"column":1,"offset":892},"end":{"line":34,"column":32,"offset":923}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"創作者驗證系統維護了一個代幣創作者列表，每個創作者都有一個經過驗證的屬性，提供了真實創作者授權的加密證明。此驗證防止冒充並為數字資產建立可靠的來源追蹤。","position":{"start":{"line":36,"column":1,"offset":927},"end":{"line":36,"column":77,"offset":1003}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":36,"column":1,"offset":927},"end":{"line":36,"column":77,"offset":1003}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"集成的版稅系統通過分配給每個創作者的分成屬性實現了自動化的收入分配。市場可以以程式化方式參考這些百分比，根據預定協議分配二次銷售收益，消除了手動計算和信任依賴。","position":{"start":{"line":38,"column":1,"offset":1007},"end":{"line":38,"column":81,"offset":1087}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":38,"column":1,"offset":1007},"end":{"line":38,"column":81,"offset":1087}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"這創造了可持續的經濟模式，讓創作者在初次銷售後仍能從其作品中持續獲益。","position":{"start":{"line":40,"column":1,"offset":1091},"end":{"line":40,"column":36,"offset":1126}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":40,"column":1,"offset":1091},"end":{"line":40,"column":36,"offset":1126}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Token Metadata 程式成功地彌合了原始區塊鏈數據與用戶可訪問的數字資產之間的差距。通過為鑄造帳戶添加豐富的上下文信息，該程式使應用程式能夠以有意義的方式顯示、分類和互動使用代幣。","position":{"start":{"line":42,"column":1,"offset":1130},"end":{"line":42,"column":96,"offset":1225}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":42,"column":1,"offset":1130},"end":{"line":42,"column":96,"offset":1225}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"這一元數據層為 Solana 上現有的多樣化數字資產生態系統奠定了基礎。","position":{"start":{"line":44,"column":1,"offset":1229},"end":{"line":44,"column":37,"offset":1265}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":44,"column":1,"offset":1229},"end":{"line":44,"column":37,"offset":1265}}},{"type":"mdxJsxFlowElement","name":"ArticleSection","attributes":[{"type":"mdxJsxAttribute","name":"name","value":"Master Edition Account","position":{"start":{"line":46,"column":17,"offset":1285},"end":{"line":46,"column":46,"offset":1314}}},{"type":"mdxJsxAttribute","name":"id","value":"master-edition-account","position":{"start":{"line":46,"column":47,"offset":1315},"end":{"line":46,"column":74,"offset":1342}}},{"type":"mdxJsxAttribute","name":"level","value":"h2","position":{"start":{"line":46,"column":75,"offset":1343},"end":{"line":46,"column":85,"offset":1353}}}],"children":[],"position":{"start":{"line":46,"column":1,"offset":1269},"end":{"line":46,"column":88,"offset":1356}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"雖然 Metadata 帳戶能有效支持同質化和非同質化代幣，但要確保真實的 NFT 特性，還需要額外的控制機制。","position":{"start":{"line":48,"column":1,"offset":1360},"end":{"line":48,"column":57,"offset":1416}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":48,"column":1,"offset":1360},"end":{"line":48,"column":57,"offset":1416}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Master Edition","position":{"start":{"line":50,"column":1,"offset":1420},"end":{"line":50,"column":17,"offset":1436}}},{"type":"text","value":" 帳戶作為一個專門的 PDA，滿足了這一需求，負責管理代幣權限。該帳戶僅在 Token Metadata 程式驗證已建立正確的非同質化代幣屬性後才會創建。","position":{"start":{"line":50,"column":17,"offset":1436},"end":{"line":50,"column":94,"offset":1513}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":50,"column":1,"offset":1420},"end":{"line":50,"column":94,"offset":1513}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Master Edition 系統採用了一種複雜的權限管理方法。該程式並非永久銷毀鑄造權限，而是將鑄造和凍結權限轉移到 Master Edition PDA。這種設計相比永久作廢的權限提供了更高的安全性和功能性，同時保持對代幣創建和管理的嚴格控制。","position":{"start":{"line":52,"column":1,"offset":1517},"end":{"line":52,"column":125,"offset":1641}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":52,"column":1,"offset":1517},"end":{"line":52,"column":125,"offset":1641}}},{"type":"blockquote","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"閱讀","position":{"start":{"line":54,"column":3,"offset":1647},"end":{"line":54,"column":5,"offset":1649}}},{"type":"link","title":null,"url":"https://developers.metaplex.com/token-metadata/faq#why-are-the-mint-and-freeze-authorities-transferred-to-the-edition-pda","children":[{"type":"text","value":"常見問題","position":{"start":{"line":54,"column":6,"offset":1650},"end":{"line":54,"column":10,"offset":1654}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":54,"column":5,"offset":1649},"end":{"line":54,"column":134,"offset":1778}}},{"type":"text","value":"以了解此選擇背後的原因。","position":{"start":{"line":54,"column":134,"offset":1778},"end":{"line":54,"column":146,"offset":1790}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":54,"column":3,"offset":1647},"end":{"line":54,"column":146,"offset":1790}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":54,"column":1,"offset":1645},"end":{"line":54,"column":146,"offset":1790}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Master Edition","position":{"start":{"line":56,"column":1,"offset":1794},"end":{"line":56,"column":17,"offset":1810}}},{"type":"text","value":" 帳戶的種子如下：","position":{"start":{"line":56,"column":17,"offset":1810},"end":{"line":56,"column":26,"offset":1819}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":56,"column":1,"offset":1794},"end":{"line":56,"column":26,"offset":1819}}},{"type":"code","lang":"rust","meta":null,"value":"const ID: Pubkey = solana_pubkey::pubkey!(\"metaqbxxUerdq28cj1RbAWkYQm3ybzjb6a8bt518x1s\");\r\n\r\nconst PREFIX: &str = \"metadata\";\r\nconst EDITION: &str = \"edition\";\r\n\r\nlet (master_edition, _) = Pubkey::find_program_address(\r\n    &[\r\n        PREFIX.as_bytes(), \r\n        &ID, \r\n        mint.as_ref()\r\n        EDITION.as_bytes(),\r\n    ], \r\n    &ID  \r\n);","position":{"start":{"line":58,"column":1,"offset":1823},"end":{"line":73,"column":4,"offset":2183}},"data":{"highlightId":"code-1"}},{"type":"mdxJsxFlowElement","name":"ArticleSection","attributes":[{"type":"mdxJsxAttribute","name":"name","value":"Programmable NFTs","position":{"start":{"line":75,"column":17,"offset":2203},"end":{"line":75,"column":41,"offset":2227}}},{"type":"mdxJsxAttribute","name":"id","value":"programmable-nfts","position":{"start":{"line":75,"column":42,"offset":2228},"end":{"line":75,"column":64,"offset":2250}}},{"type":"mdxJsxAttribute","name":"level","value":"h2","position":{"start":{"line":75,"column":65,"offset":2251},"end":{"line":75,"column":75,"offset":2261}}}],"children":[],"position":{"start":{"line":75,"column":1,"offset":2187},"end":{"line":75,"column":78,"offset":2264}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"可編程 NFT（pNFTs）是一種先進的代幣標準，能在協議層面強制執行可自定義的行為和限制。","position":{"start":{"line":77,"column":1,"offset":2268},"end":{"line":77,"column":47,"offset":2314}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":77,"column":1,"offset":2268},"end":{"line":77,"column":47,"offset":2314}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"t